{"id":"vod_bf_15569","vodId":"15569","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"监狱学园","name_cn":"监狱学园","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-16/036d04a41a931caf76dae1de8280796d.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在位于东京郊外的私立八光学园之中，这所学校致力于培养高贵纯洁的千金大小姐并因此远近闻名。然而，令众人都无法相信的是，自2011年4月起，这所从未被男子所踏足过的圣殿，竟然开始招收男生，而以藤野清志（中川大志 饰）为首的五个男生成为了这所学校历史上的首批男子学员。　　在诸葛岳人（柄本时生 饰）、若本真吾（矢野圣人 饰）、安德烈（坂本祐介 饰）和根津让二（宫城大树 饰）的怂恿之下，藤野清志决定和他们一同去偷窥女澡堂，然而很快就落网的四人当然遭受到了来自于校园内部神秘组织“里学生会”的惩罚。他们被监禁在“监狱”之中，每日都要受到会长栗园万里（山崎紘菜 饰）等学生会骨干的“折磨”和“蹂躏”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:49:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/jianyuxueyuan/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jianyuxueyuan/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/jianyuxueyuan/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jianyuxueyuan/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241210uhdqfX0lindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/jianyuxueyuan/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jianyuxueyuan/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/jianyuxueyuan/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jianyuxueyuan/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/jianyuxueyuan/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241210rwB8cUorindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241210Sa7HqDQVindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:14.624Z"}